{"steam_appid":4760480,"steam_name":"You Are Empty: Absolute Edition","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4760480/588424345/79b80218479b0959f57d262202d4938e4896afea/1788627309/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788628531","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257396339/ffd15d42aeac5e78bd9aff6a97c41e1565ba48ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788628531","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/5a97edbecf9012ef114d62a09a29a1534fbc7440/ss_5a97edbecf9012ef114d62a09a29a1534fbc7440.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793109399","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/b984f295f6b63c827b1363fa38c0cb08811abadb/ss_b984f295f6b63c827b1363fa38c0cb08811abadb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793109399","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/c1a659c705bd3b03fc014a6d9973558eafe9bd2d/ss_c1a659c705bd3b03fc014a6d9973558eafe9bd2d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793109399","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/1bc00af9b5b6ff24c8b5afcaf03d32646fcf08c1/ss_1bc00af9b5b6ff24c8b5afcaf03d32646fcf08c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793109399","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/54e586826127bf7e58d5e6759cc8ecc6cf180c62/ss_54e586826127bf7e58d5e6759cc8ecc6cf180c62.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793109399"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/a49dff358692a85bc17e9107faf6cff8.avif?t=1793109399\" alt=\"A forgotten cult classic shooter set in a Soviet totalitarian society.\" width=1200 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.poster.avif?t=1793109399\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.webm?t=1793109399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/205fbbe93d51583e14033f20b025a978.mp4?t=1793109399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/d8238c6f15bc9ba60726f17933ca5226.avif?t=1793109399\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate history 1950s Soviet Kyiv, most of the city's population has mysteriously vanished, and uncontrollable, horrific monsters roam its abandoned streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate has brought you face to face with the ominous emptiness of a dead city that watches its only visitor with unwavering attention. Face bizarre enemies born from propaganda, science, and madness as you uncover the truth behind the catastrophe, and try to make things right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/48641ccdc82da77862524f59293f4a43.avif?t=1793109399\" alt=\"RESTORED, REJUVINATED, REARMED!\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal locations across an alternate history Soviet Union, including collective farms, the Metro, an opera house, city rooftops, secret laboratories, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an arsenal of classic weapons, including the C96 Broomhandle pistol, PPSh submachine gun, Mosin rifle, double barrel shotgun, Molotov cocktails, and experimental retrofuturistic weaponry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive, grotesque enemies inspired by Soviet themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one of Eastern Europe's most unusual cult FPS titles, faithfully revitalized for modern systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760480/extras/c2bc25805f05fccb16ecd64f846eae6b.avif?t=1793109399\" alt=\"\"width=1200 height=400 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD with at least 2 cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB VRAM GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game will run on almost any computer, including laptops with integrated graphics.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action"],"developers":["Digital Spray Studios","Mandel ArtPlains","Jordan Freeman Group","ZOOM Platform Media"],"publishers":["Strategy First","BillionTech"],"release_date":"Oct 27, 2026"}